    <span class="eyebrow hero-eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span>{% if lang == "de" %}Einsatzbereiche{% else %}Fields of Application{% endif %}</span>
    <h1 data-split-lines class="mt-3">{% if lang == "de" %}Wo LIBA <em class="serif-italic">arbeitet.</em>{% else %}Where LIBA <em class="serif-italic">works.</em>{% endif %}</h1>
    <p>{% if lang == "de" %}Glasfaser, Pipeline, Strom, Wasser, Sport, Agrar, Bergbau, Gleis. Sechzig Jahre Maschinenentwicklung — abgestimmt auf reale Aufgaben unter realen Bedingungen.{% else %}Fibre optic, pipeline, power, water, sports, agriculture, mining, track. Sixty years of machine development — tailored to real tasks under real conditions.{% endif %}</p>
    <div class="hero-actions mt-4">
      <a href="{% if lang == 'en' %}https://lukabpunkt.github.io/Lingener-Baumaschinen/en/referenzen.html{% else %}https://lukabpunkt.github.io/Lingener-Baumaschinen/referenzen.html{% endif %}" class="btn btn-primary is-lg">
        {% if lang == "de" %}Referenzprojekte ansehen{% else %}View reference projects{% endif %}
        <svg class="arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">

    <div id="glasfaser" class="split align-start reveal">
      <div>
        <span class="section-index">{% if lang == "de" %}01 / Telekommunikation{% else %}01 / Telecommunications{% endif %}</span>
        <h2 class="mt-3">{% if lang == "de" %}Glasfaser­ausbau{% else %}Fibre Optic Rollout{% endif %}</h2>
        <p class="lead mt-3">{% if lang == "de" %}Schmale Gräben, schnelle Vortriebsgeschwindigkeit, minimale Schädigung der Oberfläche. LIBA-Fräsen verlegen tagelang stabil bis zu 1.000 Meter Glasfaser-Trasse pro Tag — wirtschaftlich überlegen gegenüber Bagger und Trennsäge.{% else %}Narrow trenches, fast advance speed, minimal surface damage. LIBA cutters work steadily day after day, achieving up to 1,000 metres of fibre optic route per day — economically superior to excavators and cut-off saws.{% endif %}</p>
        <ul class="spec-list is-kerf">
          <li><strong>{% if lang == "de" %}Empfohlene Modelle{% else %}Recommended models{% endif %}</strong><span class="spec-desc">GM 600 R · {% if lang == "de" %}GM 4 Raupe{% else %}GM 4 Crawler{% endif %} · GM 450 H · GM 180 AF</span></li>
          <li><strong>{% if lang == "de" %}Trassengeometrie{% else %}Route geometry{% endif %}</strong><span class="spec-desc">{% if lang == "de" %}Schnittbreiten ab 80 mm — präzise und reproduzierbar.{% else %}Cut widths from 80 mm — precise and reproducible.{% endif %}</span></li>
          <li><strong>{% if lang == "de" %}Tagesleistung{% else %}Daily output{% endif %}</strong><span class="spec-desc">{% if lang == "de" %}Bis zu 1.000 Laufmeter im Vortrieb (bodenabhängig).{% else %}Up to 1,000 linear metres in advance (ground-dependent).{% endif %}</span></li>
        </ul>
        <a href="{% if lang == 'de' %}/maschinen.html#selbstfahrer{% else %}/en/maschinen.html#selbstfahrer{% endif %}" class="btn-link mt-4">{% if lang == "de" %}Passende Maschinen ansehen{% else %}View matching machines{% endif %} <svg class="arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" width="16" height="16"><path d="M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></a>
      </div>
      <div class="media-frame"><img loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/applications/glasfaser.webp" alt="" width="1536" height="1152"><span class="tag">FTTH · FTTB · Backbone</span></div>
    </div>

    <hr class="divider">

    <div id="pipeline" class="split align-start reverse reveal">
      <div>
        <span class="section-index">{% if lang == "de" %}02 / Versorgung{% else %}02 / Utilities{% endif %}</span>
        <h2 class="mt-3">{% if lang == "de" %}Pipeline &amp; Rohrleitungsbau{% else %}Pipeline &amp; Pipe Installation{% endif %}</h2>
        <p class="lead mt-3">{% if lang == "de" %}Gas, Wasser, Abwasser, Fernwärme — präzise Gräben für sichere Versorgungstrassen mit definierten Wandungen und stabilem Bett.{% else %}Gas, water, sewage, district heating — precise trenches for safe utility routes with defined walls and a stable bed.{% endif %}</p>
        <ul class="spec-list is-kerf">
          <li><strong>{% if lang == "de" %}Empfohlene Modelle{% else %}Recommended models{% endif %}</strong><span class="spec-desc">GM 180 AF · GM 140 AFH-600 · GM 6 ASR</span></li>
          <li><strong>{% if lang == "de" %}Frästiefe{% else %}Cutting depth{% endif %}</strong><span class="spec-desc">{% if lang == "de" %}Bis 1.800 mm, optional mit Verlege- und Verfüll­einrichtung.{% else %}Up to 1,800 mm, optionally with installation and backfill equipment.{% endif %}</span></li>
          <li><strong>{% if lang == "de" %}Rohrgrößen{% else %}Pipe sizes{% endif %}</strong><span class="spec-desc">DN 50 — DN 600, {% if lang == "de" %}konfigurierbar{% else %}configurable{% endif %}.</span></li>
        </ul>
        <a href="{% if lang == 'de' %}/maschinen.html#anbau-bagger{% else %}/en/maschinen.html#anbau-bagger{% endif %}" class="btn-link mt-4">{% if lang == "de" %}Passende Maschinen ansehen{% else %}View matching machines{% endif %} <svg class="arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" width="16" height="16"><path d="M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></a>
      </div>
      <div class="media-frame"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="/assets/images/applications/rohrleitungsbau.webp"><img loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/applications/rohrleitungsbau.jpg" alt="" width="1024" height="768"></picture><span class="tag">DN 50 — DN 600</span></div>
    </div>

    <hr class="divider">

    <div id="kabel" class="split align-start reveal">
      <div>
        <span class="section-index">{% if lang == "de" %}03 / Energie{% else %}03 / Energy{% endif %}</span>
        <h2 class="mt-3">{% if lang == "de" %}Strom- &amp; Solar­trassen{% else %}Power &amp; Solar Cable Routes{% endif %}</h2>
        <p class="lead mt-3">{% if lang == "de" %}Erdkabel-Verlegung für Solarparks, Windparks, Mittelspannung. Eine LIBA-Fräse macht aus mehreren Wochen Bagger-Einsatz wenige Tage planbaren Vortrieb.{% else %}Earth cable installation for solar parks, wind farms and medium-voltage networks. A LIBA cutter turns weeks of excavator work into a few days of planned, predictable progress.{% endif %}</p>
        <ul class="spec-list is-kerf">
          <li><strong>{% if lang == "de" %}Empfohlene Modelle{% else %}Recommended models{% endif %}</strong><span class="spec-desc">{% if lang == "de" %}GM 4 Allrad · GM 4 Raupe · GMV 130 Vibrationspflug{% else %}GM 4 All-Wheel · GM 4 Crawler · GMV 130 vibrating plough{% endif %}</span></li>
          <li><strong>{% if lang == "de" %}Simultanverlegung{% else %}Simultaneous installation{% endif %}</strong><span class="spec-desc">{% if lang == "de" %}Fräsen + Kabel verlegen + Verfüllen in einem Arbeitsgang.{% else %}Cutting + cable laying + backfilling in a single pass.{% endif %}</span></li>
        </ul>
        <a href="{% if lang == 'de' %}/maschinen.html#selbstfahrer{% else %}/en/maschinen.html#selbstfahrer{% endif %}" class="btn-link mt-4">{% if lang == "de" %}Passende Maschinen ansehen{% else %}View matching machines{% endif %} <svg class="arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" width="16" height="16"><path d="M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></a>
      </div>
      <div class="media-frame"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="/assets/images/applications/kabelverlegung.webp"><img loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/applications/kabelverlegung.jpg" alt="" width="1024" height="768"></picture><span class="tag">{% if lang == "de" %}PV · Wind · Mittelspannung{% else %}PV · Wind · Medium voltage{% endif %}</span></div>
    </div>

    <hr class="divider">

    <div id="drainage" class="split align-start reverse reveal">
      <div>
        <span class="section-index">{% if lang == "de" %}04 / Sport &amp; Drainage{% else %}04 / Sports &amp; Drainage{% endif %}</span>
        <h2 class="mt-3">{% if lang == "de" %}Sportplatzbau &amp; Drainage{% else %}Sports Field Construction &amp; Drainage{% endif %}</h2>
        <p class="lead mt-3">{% if lang == "de" %}Drainagegräben in Rasen- und Kunstrasenanlagen — präzise, schmal und mit minimaler Schädigung der Spielfläche. Auch für Golfplätze und Hippodrome bewährt.{% else %}Drainage trenches in natural and artificial turf installations — precise, narrow and with minimal damage to the playing surface. Also proven on golf courses and equestrian arenas.{% endif %}</p>
        <ul class="spec-list is-kerf">
          <li><strong>{% if lang == "de" %}Empfohlene Modelle{% else %}Recommended models{% endif %}</strong><span class="spec-desc">{% if lang == "de" %}GM 4 Allrad{% else %}GM 4 All-Wheel{% endif %} · GM 450 H · GM 180 AF · GM 300 HF</span></li>
          <li><strong>{% if lang == "de" %}Oberflächenschutz{% else %}Surface protection{% endif %}</strong><span class="spec-desc">{% if lang == "de" %}Minimale Spurbildung, schnelle Wiederherstellung.{% else %}Minimal rutting, rapid reinstatement.{% endif %}</span></li>
        </ul>
        <a href="{% if lang == 'de' %}/maschinen.html#selbstfahrer{% else %}/en/maschinen.html#selbstfahrer{% endif %}" class="btn-link mt-4">{% if lang == "de" %}Passende Maschinen ansehen{% else %}View matching machines{% endif %} <svg class="arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" width="16" height="16"><path d="M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></a>
      </div>
      <div class="media-frame"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="/assets/images/applications/sportplatzbau.webp"><img loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/applications/sportplatzbau.jpg" alt="" width="1024" height="768"></picture><span class="tag">{% if lang == "de" %}Rasen · Kunstrasen · Golf{% else %}Natural turf · Artificial turf · Golf{% endif %}</span></div>
    </div>

    <hr class="divider">

    <div id="landwirtschaft" class="split align-start reveal">
      <div>
        <span class="section-index">{% if lang == "de" %}05 / Agrar{% else %}05 / Agriculture{% endif %}</span>
        <h2 class="mt-3">{% if lang == "de" %}Landwirtschaft &amp; Bewässerung{% else %}Agriculture &amp; Irrigation{% endif %}</h2>
        <p class="lead mt-3">{% if lang == "de" %}Drainage- und Bewässerungsgräben für Felder, Plantagen, Weinberge — abgestimmt auf den Bauernhof-Traktor und die landwirtschaftliche Saisonpflicht.{% else %}Drainage and irrigation trenches for fields, plantations and vineyards — matched to the farm tractor and the demands of the agricultural season.{% endif %}</p>
        <ul class="spec-list is-kerf">
          <li><strong>{% if lang == "de" %}Empfohlene Modelle{% else %}Recommended models{% endif %}</strong><span class="spec-desc">{% if lang == "de" %}GMV 100 Pflug · GM 180 AF · GM 1800 P · GMV 130{% else %}GMV 100 plough · GM 180 AF · GM 1800 P · GMV 130{% endif %}</span></li>
          <li><strong>{% if lang == "de" %}Anbau{% else %}Attachment{% endif %}</strong><span class="spec-desc">{% if lang == "de" %}Standard-Dreipunkt für gängige Schlepper.{% else %}Standard three-point linkage for common tractors.{% endif %}</span></li>
        </ul>
        <a href="{% if lang == 'de' %}/maschinen.html#pfluege{% else %}/en/maschinen.html#pfluege{% endif %}" class="btn-link mt-4">{% if lang == "de" %}Passende Maschinen ansehen{% else %}View matching machines{% endif %} <svg class="arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" width="16" height="16"><path d="M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></a>
      </div>
      <div class="media-frame"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="/assets/images/applications/landwirtschaft.webp"><img loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/applications/landwirtschaft.jpg" alt="" width="1024" height="768"></picture><span class="tag">{% if lang == "de" %}Drainage · Bewässerung{% else %}Drainage · Irrigation{% endif %}</span></div>
    </div>

    <hr class="divider">

    <div id="tiefbau" class="split align-start reverse reveal">
      <div>
        <span class="section-index">{% if lang == "de" %}06 / Spezialbau{% else %}06 / Special Construction{% endif %}</span>
        <h2 class="mt-3">{% if lang == "de" %}Bergbau, Felsen &amp; Gleisbau{% else %}Mining, Rock &amp; Track Construction{% endif %}</h2>
        <p class="lead mt-3">{% if lang == "de" %}Wo Bagger an Grenzen kommen, fängt LIBA erst an. Extrem harte Böden, felsiger Untergrund, beengte Bedingungen entlang von Gleisen.{% else %}Where excavators reach their limits, LIBA is just getting started. Extremely hard ground, rocky subsoil, confined conditions alongside railway tracks.{% endif %}</p>
        <ul class="spec-list is-kerf">
          <li><strong>{% if lang == "de" %}Empfohlene Modelle{% else %}Recommended models{% endif %}</strong><span class="spec-desc">{% if lang == "de" %}GM 6 ASR Felsfräse · GM 4 Allrad · GM 140 AFH-600{% else %}GM 6 ASR rock cutter · GM 4 All-Wheel · GM 140 AFH-600{% endif %}</span></li>
          <li><strong>{% if lang == "de" %}Werkzeug{% else %}Tooling{% endif %}</strong><span class="spec-desc">{% if lang == "de" %}Hartmetall-Meißel, kundenspezifisch konfigurierbar.{% else %}Tungsten carbide picks, customer-specifically configurable.{% endif %}</span></li>
        </ul>
        <a href="{% if lang == 'de' %}/maschinen.html#spezial{% else %}/en/maschinen.html#spezial{% endif %}" class="btn-link mt-4">{% if lang == "de" %}Passende Maschinen ansehen{% else %}View matching machines{% endif %} <svg class="arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" width="16" height="16"><path d="M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></a>
      </div>
      <div class="media-frame"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="/assets/images/applications/baustelle.webp"><img loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/applications/baustelle.jpg" alt="" width="1536" height="1024"></picture><span class="tag">{% if lang == "de" %}Bergbau · Gleis · Fels{% else %}Mining · Track · Rock{% endif %}</span></div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" style="padding-top: 0;">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="cta-block reveal">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow is-dark"><span class="dot"></span>{% if lang == "de" %}Konkretes Projekt{% else %}Specific Project{% endif %}</span>
        <h2 class="mt-3">{% if lang == "de" %}Wir kennen<br>Ihren <em>Boden.</em>{% else %}We know<br>your <em>ground.</em>{% endif %}</h2>
        <p>{% if lang == "de" %}Sand, Mergel, Fels, Lehm, Asphalt — schicken Sie uns Bodengutachten oder Standortfotos. Wir empfehlen Maschine und Werkzeugbestückung.{% else %}Sand, marl, rock, clay, tarmac — send us soil reports or site photographs. We'll recommend the machine and tooling configuration.{% endif %}</p>
        <div class="actions">
          <a href="{% if lang == 'de' %}/kontakt.html{% else %}/en/kontakt.html{% endif %}" class="btn btn-accent is-lg">{% if lang == "de" %}Projekt besprechen{% else %}Discuss your project{% endif %} <svg class="arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <dl class="cta-side">
        <dt>{% if lang == "de" %}Direkter Werkskontakt{% else %}Direct factory contact{% endif %}</dt>
        <dd>+49 (0) 591 76 314</dd>
        <dt>{% if lang == "de" %}E-Mail{% else %}Email{% endif %}</dt>
        <dd style="word-break: break-word;">info@lingener-baumaschinen.de</dd>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
